{
  "name": "Synctify — WP 發佈回呼 → Notion 標記已發佈",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "synctify-published-CHANGE-ME-TO-A-RANDOM-STRING",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pub001",
      "name": "WP 發佈回呼（Webhook）",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "pub002",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Synctify Notion Button"
        }
      },
      "notes": "由輔助外掛（0.2.0+）觸發，不是 Notion 按鈕。\n\nWP 端要在 wp-config.php 定義三個常數：\n  SYNCTIFY_PUBLISH_WEBHOOK_URL    ← 本節點的 Production URL\n  SYNCTIFY_PUBLISH_WEBHOOK_HEADER ← 與憑證同名的 header\n  SYNCTIFY_PUBLISH_WEBHOOK_SECRET ← 與憑證同值\n未定義時外掛靜默停用回呼，其他功能不受影響。\n\n憑證沿用「Synctify Notion Button」——同一批人、同一個信任邊界，\n分開兩組密鑰只是多一份要輪替的東西，換不到實質隔離。"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "pub003",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body?.notion_page_id ?? '' }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "pub004",
      "name": "有帶 Notion 母列 id？",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "非同步流程建立的文章沒有這個 meta，外掛本來就不會送；\n這裡再擋一次，避免把空 id 打進 Notion API。"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "pub005",
      "name": "略過（非同步文章）",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://api.notion.com/v1/pages/{{ $json.body.notion_page_id }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "notionApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"properties\": { \"上稿狀態\": { \"select\": { \"name\": \"已發佈\" } }, \"最後同步時間\": { \"date\": { \"start\": $now.toISO() } } } } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "pub006",
      "name": "Notion：標記已發佈",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        140,
        220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "notionApi": {
          "id": "xfGHH7Wx4EucMC0X",
          "name": "Support Center Sync"
        }
      },
      "notes": "兩種 event 都寫「已發佈」：\n  published                → 新文章從草稿發佈\n  elementor_draft_applied  → 既有已發佈文章套用了 Elementor 草稿\n對小編而言兩者是同一件事：站上內容已經是最新的。"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
